1087
00:43:58.460 --> 00:44:00.640
in form of roll-ons, but are you familiar

1088
00:44:00.640 --> 00:44:02.740
with the concept of periodized training?

1089
00:44:02.740 --> 00:44:03.750
No.

1090
00:44:03.750 --> 00:44:05.228
